[Desktop Entry]
Version=1.0
Type=Application
Name=Isaac Sim (in this browser desktop)
Comment=Runs Isaac Sim in a window on this desktop with ROS 2 Humble. Convenient, but the desktop capture path caps it near a quarter of native FPS — use "Isaac Sim — Streaming (fast)" when frame rate matters.
